BRepCheck_Shell: the orientation check (Orientation) searched each face at
an edge for the edge with an explorer of all the face's edges, once per
edge of the shell: quadratic in the edges of a face (a shell of 23 430
faces whose two plates hold 23 428 edges each took 9.6 s). For a face of 64
edges or more, the orientations of its edges as its explorer meets them
(the face oriented as in the shell) are now listed once, and the first or
second occurrence of an edge is read from the list; faces of fewer edges,
and an edge a list does not hold, are searched as before. The statuses are
unchanged.
